WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.460 --> 01:42.300
[Episode 30]

01:43.150 --> 01:44.050
In these five hundred years,

01:44.840 --> 01:46.410
don't you feel we forgot something?

01:48.590 --> 01:49.380
Like,

01:50.920 --> 01:52.770
how did we first meet?

01:53.280 --> 01:54.050
Like,

01:55.680 --> 01:57.290
why are we dressed like this?

01:57.870 --> 01:58.660
And

01:59.680 --> 02:00.620
don't you think

02:02.310 --> 02:04.100
Bear Island is missing someone?

02:07.640 --> 02:08.980
If the heart is there,

02:09.240 --> 02:10.170
the sword is there.

02:11.280 --> 02:12.410
Who told these words

02:13.310 --> 02:15.690
to me?

02:35.120 --> 02:36.890
Such a familiar scent.

02:36.890 --> 02:41.940
[Hall of United Spirits]

02:47.080 --> 02:47.850
Mentor.

02:49.470 --> 02:50.260
Mentor.

02:50.430 --> 02:51.220
Mentor.

03:16.910 --> 03:18.540
The celestial music drifts

03:19.520 --> 03:20.850
like a spring breeze.

03:22.520 --> 03:24.220
Yunxiao, your mastery of music

03:24.750 --> 03:27.100
may now surpass mine.

03:29.000 --> 03:30.010
In return,

03:30.520 --> 03:33.260
I shall give you tonight's painting...

03:41.000 --> 03:41.820
Deity,

03:41.910 --> 03:44.010
all is ready as you ordered.

03:58.030 --> 03:58.890
What is happening?

03:59.030 --> 04:00.290
Who opened the Water Dragon Spout?

04:00.360 --> 04:01.380
We do not know.

04:01.960 --> 04:02.890
East Sea warriors!

04:03.120 --> 04:03.890
On guard!

04:04.120 --> 04:04.890
Yes.

04:06.520 --> 04:07.450
I came first.

04:11.680 --> 04:12.540
And me.

04:24.480 --> 04:25.250
Aunt.

04:25.560 --> 04:26.170
Xuanya.

04:26.190 --> 04:26.930
Junior.

04:27.920 --> 04:28.490
Ling'e.

04:28.510 --> 04:29.810
Mentor, are you all right?

04:31.920 --> 04:32.730
Aunt.

04:35.720 --> 04:36.020
You...

04:36.240 --> 04:37.020
Your Majesty,

04:37.430 --> 04:38.660
why so plainly dressed today?

04:40.390 --> 04:42.610
Why are you

04:43.070 --> 04:44.490
here so late?

04:46.310 --> 04:47.220
Again?

04:55.160 --> 04:56.610
I brought them here.

04:56.680 --> 04:57.930
Fairy Yunxiao,

04:58.310 --> 05:00.900
you barged in here.

05:01.240 --> 05:02.660
What is your intent?

05:08.190 --> 05:09.220
Youqin Xuanya,

05:09.720 --> 05:10.980
your inner demon once stopped you

05:11.480 --> 05:12.930
from using your flame art.

05:13.600 --> 05:15.290
Who helped you overcome it?

05:25.000 --> 05:25.780
Qi Yuan,

05:26.160 --> 05:28.540
you once had a deep feud
with Kuai Si of Mistveil Division.

05:28.720 --> 05:29.980
Who aided you in your revenge

05:30.000 --> 05:31.170
and killing Kuai Si?

05:33.190 --> 05:34.170
Yes.

05:34.630 --> 05:35.930
My foundation was ruined.

05:36.510 --> 05:37.900
I could not defeat Kuai Si.

05:38.750 --> 05:39.900
Who helped me?

05:42.850 --> 05:45.650
That remains a mystery
in Ascendance Sect.

05:49.920 --> 05:50.900
Five hundred years ago,

05:51.190 --> 05:52.580
the Way bonds surged
in the Mortal Realm.

05:52.750 --> 05:53.730
Who helped you?

05:54.870 --> 05:56.460
I worked hard at matchmaking.

05:56.480 --> 05:57.340
Answer me.

05:57.720 --> 05:58.660
Who helped you?

06:00.480 --> 06:02.730
I do not know.

06:06.600 --> 06:07.340
Five hundred years ago,

06:07.360 --> 06:08.540
you had no power to transform
into a dragon.

06:09.120 --> 06:10.930
How could you become the Dragon King?

06:11.630 --> 06:13.700
Who helped you train in the Mortal Realm

06:14.160 --> 06:15.490
and return for the succession struggle?

06:18.800 --> 06:20.370
When we met at Bear Stockade,

06:20.920 --> 06:23.250
besides you, Hua Ritian, and me,

06:23.480 --> 06:24.410
there was one more person.

06:25.120 --> 06:26.580
Do you not remember who he was?

06:31.160 --> 06:31.700
I...

06:32.160 --> 06:33.170
Five hundred years ago,

06:33.510 --> 06:34.540
there was once someone.

06:35.360 --> 06:36.610
Do none of you remember him?

06:42.950 --> 06:43.730
Back then,

06:44.430 --> 06:46.490
Yuan Qing of Mistveil Division hurt me

06:46.630 --> 06:47.700
and left me with an inner demon.

06:48.040 --> 06:49.490
With my cultivation then,

06:49.720 --> 06:51.900
I could never escape it.

06:53.120 --> 06:54.050
But I still cannot recall

06:55.680 --> 06:57.610
who they were.

07:02.120 --> 07:03.020
This pendant's design

07:03.390 --> 07:04.540
is truly unique.

07:04.920 --> 07:05.780
Somehow,

07:05.800 --> 07:07.370
it feels deeply familiar to me.

07:07.480 --> 07:09.140
I asked everyone in Ascendance Sect,

07:09.160 --> 07:10.340
but no one knew

07:10.920 --> 07:13.020
who had given it to me.

07:14.870 --> 07:15.850
I keep feeling

07:16.120 --> 07:17.250
I'm not the only

07:17.270 --> 07:18.490
Jade Division disciple.

07:21.270 --> 07:22.900
Mentor, do you know Evasion Art?

07:23.120 --> 07:24.290
My foundation was ruined.

07:24.310 --> 07:25.780
How could I know Evasion Art?

07:26.070 --> 07:26.780
True.

07:27.000 --> 07:28.250
Of all arts under heaven,

07:28.270 --> 07:29.730
I alone master Evasion Art.

07:29.750 --> 07:31.540
If you did not teach me, Mentor,

07:31.920 --> 07:33.100
then who else could it be?

07:33.240 --> 07:34.140
Yes, yes.

07:34.870 --> 07:35.980
And in my mind,

07:36.000 --> 07:37.340
these words often arise:

07:38.950 --> 07:40.140
Live in peace,

07:40.360 --> 07:41.490
think of trouble.

07:41.870 --> 07:43.700
Stay steady, shun karma.

07:44.510 --> 07:46.580
These words are crystal clear in my mind

07:46.630 --> 07:48.810
as if I'd written them a thousand times.

07:49.070 --> 07:49.900
Sometimes,

07:49.920 --> 07:51.460
I even write them down.

07:52.950 --> 07:53.700
But

07:54.510 --> 07:55.850
I asked everyone.

07:56.240 --> 07:57.340
No one knew

07:57.390 --> 07:58.810
where those lines came from.

07:59.510 --> 08:00.780
So, you do remember.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.100
You all remember.

08:07.430 --> 08:09.900
If someone truly helped me grow up,

08:10.750 --> 08:12.810
please tell me who it was.

08:13.390 --> 08:15.410
Yunxiao, I want to know too.

08:15.430 --> 08:16.140
We all do.

08:16.160 --> 08:16.780
Wait.

08:17.920 --> 08:19.220
Don't let this go off track.

08:20.120 --> 08:21.050
I have a question.

08:22.480 --> 08:23.900
If such a person truly exists,

08:24.310 --> 08:25.730
and all of us forgot him,

08:26.870 --> 08:27.780
Fairy Yunxiao,

08:28.560 --> 08:29.700
why do you still remember?

08:30.950 --> 08:32.300
Because I once shared

08:32.750 --> 08:33.770
a spiritual bond with him.

08:34.720 --> 08:35.980
I know everything

08:37.240 --> 08:38.180
he went through.

08:39.480 --> 08:41.220
I have decided

08:43.750 --> 08:44.820
about what you asked me before.

08:47.510 --> 08:48.370
I am willing.

08:49.320 --> 08:50.370
I am willing.

08:51.240 --> 08:53.100
From now on, I will stay

08:54.200 --> 08:55.300
by your side forever.

09:08.170 --> 09:12.650
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

09:12.650 --> 09:13.940
[Formation, Evasion Art]

09:14.440 --> 09:20.880
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

09:22.900 --> 09:28.350
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

09:29.440 --> 09:36.150
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

09:37.320 --> 09:38.220
Little rascal.

09:43.360 --> 09:45.300
After struggling for 3,600 years,

09:46.200 --> 09:47.850
in the end, he gave himself up

09:49.200 --> 09:50.490
to bring us all back.

09:51.270 --> 09:58.850
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

10:01.080 --> 10:02.530
It was his sacrifice

10:03.600 --> 10:05.700
that won peace for the Primordial World.

10:06.150 --> 10:06.980
Senior.

10:11.590 --> 10:12.690
But actually,

10:13.000 --> 10:15.140
these five centuries
were never peaceful.

10:16.390 --> 10:18.220
He created a special space

10:18.790 --> 10:20.770
without Jin Chan for us.

10:23.120 --> 10:24.340
I came to the East Sea this time

10:26.480 --> 10:28.220
to find that star.

10:30.080 --> 10:31.730
I will bring the little rascal back.

10:35.550 --> 10:36.650
Do you think that is possible?

10:36.790 --> 10:38.460
He is with Fate.

10:38.510 --> 10:39.300
Yes.

10:42.600 --> 10:43.420
As long as we have her.

10:47.200 --> 10:47.980
Me?

10:53.550 --> 10:54.490
The Chaos Bell.

10:55.150 --> 10:56.180
The Chaos Bell?

10:58.840 --> 11:00.300
The Chaos Bell has one power.

11:00.870 --> 11:01.850
It can reverse time and space.

11:02.390 --> 11:04.250
Yunxiao, how do you know that?

11:04.270 --> 11:05.250
I did not know at first.

11:05.960 --> 11:08.100
But in his plans over 3,600 years,

11:08.390 --> 11:09.010
he once tried using the Chaos Bell

11:09.030 --> 11:10.460
to reverse time and space.

11:11.270 --> 11:12.370
Even so,

11:13.200 --> 11:14.980
the Great Tribulation remained.

11:15.790 --> 11:17.010
But if we can use it,

11:17.120 --> 11:17.890
we can return to the moment

11:17.910 --> 11:19.460
before he met Fate

11:20.440 --> 11:21.220
and save him.

11:23.360 --> 11:24.460
Save Senior.

11:28.910 --> 11:30.220
I will go with you

11:30.720 --> 11:31.530
to bring him back.

11:31.870 --> 11:33.460
Do not open the Chaos Bell!

11:33.750 --> 11:34.980
You must not open it!

11:38.120 --> 11:38.650
Father.

11:38.910 --> 11:40.770
Do not open the Chaos Bell.

11:41.390 --> 11:42.300
Fairy Yunxiao,

11:43.080 --> 11:44.580
for your own wish,

11:45.030 --> 11:47.300
would you erase these 500 years?

11:48.030 --> 11:48.820
Yes.

11:49.270 --> 11:50.300
You fiend!

11:50.670 --> 11:52.300
Do you know how many beings will perish

11:52.320 --> 11:53.700
if you turn back 500 years?

11:53.720 --> 11:54.770
Do you know

11:55.240 --> 11:57.010
these 500 years were never at peace?

11:57.320 --> 11:59.100
It was he who let us live here

11:59.720 --> 12:01.300
and bore all the pain alone.

12:01.320 --> 12:03.820
But if you turn back 500 years

12:03.840 --> 12:04.820
and save him,

12:05.120 --> 12:06.650
what of the Great Tribulation?

12:06.720 --> 12:07.700
That is why

12:08.390 --> 12:09.770
I waited for 500 years.

12:11.200 --> 12:12.180
500 years ago,

12:13.390 --> 12:14.460
I found him

12:14.910 --> 12:16.300
and asked him to help me.

12:24.320 --> 12:25.100
Yunxiao,

12:26.390 --> 12:28.300
you didn't ask me at all.

12:29.000 --> 12:30.650
When I refused, you beat me.

12:30.670 --> 12:32.060
Each time I refused, you beat me.

12:32.080 --> 12:33.890
I lost count of the beatings.

12:34.000 --> 12:34.890
What did he do?

12:34.910 --> 12:36.610
The same as before.

12:36.670 --> 12:37.730
He posed as a deity

12:38.120 --> 12:39.650
and made the Bear Stockade folks
quarry stone.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.250
I swear.

12:42.750 --> 12:44.650
I was ready to mend my ways

12:44.670 --> 12:45.530
and turn over a new leaf.

12:45.550 --> 12:46.370
She forced me into it.

12:48.550 --> 12:49.300
Do you know

12:49.320 --> 12:50.130
why I have lived on Bear Island

12:50.720 --> 12:52.250
for these five hundred years?

12:52.320 --> 12:53.250
Wasn't it

12:54.120 --> 12:54.730
to keep me company?

12:55.270 --> 12:56.340
The people of Bear Island

12:57.270 --> 12:58.610
are Ancestral Witch heirs.

12:59.510 --> 13:00.610
They were born upon this land

13:01.120 --> 13:02.180
and will be buried beneath it.

13:02.600 --> 13:03.730
The soil of Bear Island

13:04.030 --> 13:06.010
is made of Witch heirs' bodies.

13:06.270 --> 13:07.340
And what of it?

13:07.360 --> 13:09.220
Through the little rascal, I heard

13:09.840 --> 13:11.250
the Sea-Calming Pillar's origin.

13:12.550 --> 13:14.490
It was made by a Quasi-Saint

13:15.120 --> 13:17.530
from Witch remains over 500 years old.

13:18.870 --> 13:19.850
I see.

13:20.960 --> 13:22.890
Its origin was long a mystery.

13:23.030 --> 13:25.060
We judged only by its material

13:25.120 --> 13:26.980
that it was ancient beyond thought,

13:27.150 --> 13:29.420
perhaps older than creation.

13:29.440 --> 13:31.060
Thus, it's an innate magic instrument.

13:33.120 --> 13:33.730
Wait.

13:34.960 --> 13:35.730
A Quasi-Saint?

13:36.720 --> 13:37.490
Five hundred years?

13:38.480 --> 13:39.180
Fairy Yunxiao, you...

13:39.200 --> 13:41.100
I made a new Sea-Calming Pillar.

13:41.910 --> 13:43.100
Once I'm back to 500 years ago,

13:44.240 --> 13:45.700
I will suppress the Demon Emperor.

13:48.030 --> 13:49.980
The Chaos Bell can reverse time

13:53.200 --> 13:54.650
and preserve memory and magical power.

14:12.320 --> 14:14.250
These 500 years of peace

14:16.200 --> 14:19.340
were truly hard-won.

14:21.200 --> 14:22.730
Everyone's holiday is over.

14:23.120 --> 14:24.730
Pack up and get back to work.

14:28.150 --> 14:29.100
Fairy Yunxiao,

14:29.600 --> 14:31.490
how will you take back

14:31.790 --> 14:32.890
the Pillar you refined?

14:37.790 --> 14:38.580
You surely didn't...

15:21.030 --> 15:21.890
Little rascal.

15:31.240 --> 15:31.980
Yunxiao.

15:33.030 --> 15:34.100
It has been 500 years.

15:34.840 --> 15:36.420
At last, I have found you.

15:36.840 --> 15:37.650
Sorry to keep you waiting.

15:38.440 --> 15:39.580
Why are you here?

15:43.910 --> 15:44.890
Yunxiao, don't!

15:46.360 --> 15:47.420
You cannot stop me

15:47.600 --> 15:48.730
from making my decisions.

15:51.320 --> 15:52.100
Little rascal,

15:52.510 --> 15:54.060
do you still remember

15:54.910 --> 15:56.940
what you last told me 500 years ago?

16:00.000 --> 16:00.770
You said

16:01.720 --> 16:03.580
you would stay

16:04.000 --> 16:05.100
by my side forever.

16:06.080 --> 16:07.010
Was it true?

16:21.750 --> 16:22.530
I will.

16:24.360 --> 16:26.010
I will stay

16:27.320 --> 16:28.420
by your side forever.

16:30.320 --> 16:32.060
If you ascend, so will I.

16:33.440 --> 16:36.010
If you become a hermit, so will I.

16:37.240 --> 16:39.130
I'll follow you wherever you go,

16:41.150 --> 16:42.530
with no excuses

16:43.360 --> 16:44.580
or deceit.

16:46.320 --> 16:47.890
I would give up all I have pursued

16:47.910 --> 16:49.180
these thirty years

16:50.320 --> 16:51.340
just to bring you back.

17:16.030 --> 17:16.620
Senior,

17:17.640 --> 17:18.860
I brought everyone back.

17:19.180 --> 17:21.140
[500 years ago]

17:21.160 --> 17:21.940
Why?

17:22.640 --> 17:24.490
Why can't I ever defeat you?

17:24.750 --> 17:25.530
I will not accept this.

17:27.750 --> 17:28.530
Yunxiao.

17:30.830 --> 17:32.180
I'm here!

17:32.180 --> 17:34.300
♪But the years are full of chaos♪

17:34.610 --> 17:39.110
♪Caught in karma, stained by dust♪

17:39.880 --> 17:42.660
Time to show Jade Division's power.

17:43.640 --> 17:44.220
Break!

17:45.490 --> 17:49.210
♪Lost in fated secrets♪

17:50.960 --> 17:52.700
Now comes the true finishing move.

17:53.220 --> 17:55.220
♪Let them all come♪

17:55.220 --> 17:59.110
♪There's a perfect plan for everything♪

17:59.480 --> 18:01.430
♪Who's clamoring behind♪

18:01.960 --> 18:02.900
Take Ling'e away first.

18:02.960 --> 18:03.490
Yes.

18:04.530 --> 18:09.140
♪I steadily divine the world's fate♪

18:09.630 --> 18:11.580
♪Who plots and schemes♪

18:12.140 --> 18:14.250
♪And set formations in the world♪

18:14.730 --> 18:19.480
♪I will go in and stir things up♪

18:19.480 --> 18:20.220
It is time

18:21.110 --> 18:23.220
to meet the hero of this era.

18:30.460 --> 18:32.680
♪Some will defy fate♪

18:34.200 --> 18:35.090
Ao Yi.

18:35.640 --> 18:36.810
With your cultivation,

18:37.400 --> 18:38.940
how dare you oppose me?

18:39.750 --> 18:40.900
He is not alone.

18:42.110 --> 18:42.980
I am here too.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.700
I am here too.

18:47.550 --> 18:48.380
Today,

18:48.680 --> 18:50.090
I, Bian Zhuang,

18:50.200 --> 18:52.140
turn over a new leaf.

18:52.480 --> 18:56.230
♪Someone will answer for me♪

18:56.230 --> 19:00.000
♪Only my bonds are priceless♪

19:00.550 --> 19:03.060
♪Taking our steps together♪

19:04.480 --> 19:05.620
It's been a thousand years.

19:06.240 --> 19:07.420
It's time to wake up.

19:10.130 --> 19:12.260
♪Who's clamoring behind♪

19:12.790 --> 19:14.780
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

19:15.340 --> 19:20.070
♪I steadily divine the world's fate♪

19:20.300 --> 19:22.350
♪Who plots and schemes♪

19:22.980 --> 19:24.890
♪And set formations in the world♪

19:27.510 --> 19:28.290
Stop right there.

19:28.640 --> 19:29.330
Your Majesty,

19:29.350 --> 19:30.730
I can't speak at length now.

19:30.750 --> 19:31.420
Don't block my way.

19:31.440 --> 19:32.180
Don't go.

19:32.930 --> 19:34.820
♪Battling fierce demons♪

19:34.920 --> 19:35.700
So, you knew.

19:36.510 --> 19:37.810
She told me to stop you.

19:38.160 --> 19:38.940
She knows

19:39.110 --> 19:40.490
you are set on the Celestial Court,

19:40.920 --> 19:42.420
so you'll heed my words.

19:43.110 --> 19:44.530
She doesn't want you to stop her.

19:46.270 --> 19:47.050
Make way.

19:47.880 --> 19:48.660
Don't you dare!

19:48.880 --> 19:50.220
Even in death, I'll save her.

19:50.240 --> 19:51.700
Wouldn't she do the same?

19:52.680 --> 19:53.940
Changshou, go!

19:53.960 --> 19:55.140
- I'll hold him.
- Thanks, Moon Elder.

19:55.240 --> 19:55.810
Moon Elder!

19:55.830 --> 19:56.250
What are you doing?

19:56.270 --> 19:57.140
Go, now!

19:59.350 --> 20:00.090
Let go of me!

20:00.110 --> 20:01.530
I'll demote you to the Mortal Realm!

20:01.550 --> 20:02.330
Then do it.

20:02.350 --> 20:03.290
I've long been sick

20:03.310 --> 20:04.460
of the Marriage Division post.

20:04.480 --> 20:05.220
Demote me, then.

20:05.240 --> 20:06.980
Changshou, hurry!

20:08.830 --> 20:10.330
Even Fate

20:10.680 --> 20:12.010
will be moved by love.

20:25.790 --> 20:26.700
This body...

20:26.720 --> 20:27.860
How did it come to this?

20:27.880 --> 20:28.700
Demon Emperor,

20:29.160 --> 20:30.090
do you

20:30.160 --> 20:31.290
still like this body?

20:31.480 --> 20:33.330
What exactly did you do?

20:37.030 --> 20:38.700
I have refined this body.

20:39.270 --> 20:40.900
From now on, you are sealed by me,

20:41.400 --> 20:42.530
never to rise again.

20:46.070 --> 20:48.530
You caught my dark soul?

20:49.830 --> 20:50.940
Do not forget:

20:51.480 --> 20:53.490
I came from the first cloud.

20:53.720 --> 20:55.050
You underestimated me.

20:55.070 --> 20:56.180
Release me!

20:56.200 --> 20:57.140
Let go!

21:12.440 --> 21:13.620
Yunxiao!

21:15.720 --> 21:16.490
Little rascal?

21:29.110 --> 21:30.770
Little rascal, why are you here?

21:30.880 --> 21:31.900
You will be sealed too.

21:31.920 --> 21:32.250
Go, now!

21:32.270 --> 21:33.010
I will not leave.

21:34.110 --> 21:35.220
I came to keep my promise.

21:36.000 --> 21:36.860
What promise?

21:37.350 --> 21:38.730
I wish to stay

21:39.830 --> 21:40.730
with you forever.

21:43.510 --> 21:44.290
Do you know

21:45.240 --> 21:47.050
it took me 500 years to save you?

21:47.070 --> 21:48.420
And I spent 3,600 years

21:48.440 --> 21:49.700
to bring you back.

21:52.270 --> 21:53.660
In this lifetime,

21:54.440 --> 21:55.770
I've told so many lies.

21:56.240 --> 21:57.700
But this time, I won't deceive you.

21:59.110 --> 22:00.700
Will you stay by my side?

22:04.400 --> 22:05.460
I will.

22:07.300 --> 22:14.040
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

22:14.610 --> 22:21.750
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

22:22.210 --> 22:28.920
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

22:29.350 --> 22:36.550
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

22:36.900 --> 22:43.770
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

22:56.030 --> 22:57.530
But I cannot do it.

22:58.510 --> 22:59.290
Why?

22:59.590 --> 23:00.380
Little rascal,

23:01.110 --> 23:02.090
heed my order:

23:02.720 --> 23:04.460
Guard all living souls
in this world for me.

23:04.880 --> 23:07.140
The Great Tribulation must never return.

23:08.440 --> 23:09.530
If you cannot do this,

23:10.030 --> 23:11.620
I will never spare you.

23:13.760 --> 23:20.790
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

23:20.790 --> 23:21.570
Yunxiao!

23:26.510 --> 23:27.660
Yunxiao!

23:28.590 --> 23:29.980
This is my final wish.

23:30.590 --> 23:31.980
You must grant it.

23:36.070 --> 23:43.060
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

24:34.480 --> 24:35.050
Move aside!

25:00.480 --> 25:01.290
Jin Chan.

25:02.830 --> 25:03.490
Pay with your life.

25:57.750 --> 25:58.530
Impressive.

26:06.000 --> 26:07.090
Though you do not remember,

26:07.750 --> 26:08.770
I once said

26:09.310 --> 26:10.290
that if we ever met again,

26:10.310 --> 26:11.700
I would kill you myself.

26:51.400 --> 26:52.620
I defied the Celestial Emperor.

26:52.920 --> 26:54.250
Punish me as you wish.

26:56.200 --> 26:57.460
Fairy Yunxiao

26:59.270 --> 27:00.490
asked me to give this to you.

27:01.510 --> 27:02.660
Back then, the Demon Emperor

27:02.880 --> 27:05.050
turned a single hair
into a golden lotus

27:05.270 --> 27:06.980
to hold his soul and bring himself back.

27:07.640 --> 27:08.860
Why can't we do the same

27:09.400 --> 27:10.660
for Fairy Yunxiao?

27:22.240 --> 27:23.660
Fairy Yunxiao is not dead.

27:24.000 --> 27:26.220
Her soul remains within this.

27:26.640 --> 27:28.460
If we rebuild her body,

27:28.790 --> 27:29.860
she can come back.

27:30.680 --> 27:31.460
However,

27:32.000 --> 27:33.180
rebuilding a body

27:33.680 --> 27:34.860
is no ordinary divine art.

27:35.110 --> 27:37.010
Only one with deep cultivation...

27:37.030 --> 27:37.700
I will do it.

27:39.550 --> 27:40.330
You?

27:40.720 --> 27:42.050
This will be very difficult.

27:43.440 --> 27:44.460
We should ask

27:44.880 --> 27:45.460
the Grand Mage of Voidcity.

27:45.480 --> 27:46.220
As I said,

27:46.960 --> 27:47.660
I will do it.

27:50.030 --> 27:51.460
Even if it takes ages,

27:52.480 --> 27:54.050
I will master the arts

27:54.400 --> 27:55.380
and bring her back.

28:01.000 --> 28:02.250
This must not be left to others.

28:02.880 --> 28:03.810
It must be me.

28:07.240 --> 28:07.660
Senior.

28:07.680 --> 28:08.250
Changshou.

28:08.270 --> 28:09.140
Changshou.

28:09.160 --> 28:10.180
Senior Changshou.

28:13.610 --> 28:20.170
♪Making me lean down
and confirm slowly♪

28:21.800 --> 28:24.750
♪Not knowing what love truly is♪

28:24.750 --> 28:26.760
♪Just as it was at first♪

28:26.990 --> 28:30.860
♪Day after day, with whom to share♪

28:31.030 --> 28:34.930
♪Never walked the road
of joy and sorrow♪

28:35.170 --> 28:38.860
♪No better than a mortal♪

28:39.270 --> 28:42.010
♪Not knowing love's depth♪

28:42.260 --> 28:44.220
♪Who truly cares♪

28:47.200 --> 28:48.290
Long time no see.

28:48.560 --> 28:52.820
♪At storm's end,
stars gleam, and clouds drift♪

28:52.880 --> 28:56.990
♪Together we smile,
watching moonrise and sunset♪

29:23.770 --> 29:24.570
[Easter egg]
Senior,

29:24.620 --> 29:25.330
you

29:25.390 --> 29:26.140
play

29:26.160 --> 29:26.810
it

29:26.830 --> 29:28.090
safe.

29:36.990 --> 29:38.870
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

29:39.140 --> 29:41.200
♪I dare to live my own way♪

29:41.200 --> 29:43.430
♪In the Primordial World♪

29:43.430 --> 29:45.380
♪Who sings and drinks free♪

29:45.380 --> 29:47.690
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

29:47.910 --> 29:49.780
♪Roaming the city with reckless courage♪

29:50.240 --> 29:50.900
Amazing.

29:50.920 --> 29:51.530
Junior.

29:51.790 --> 29:52.980
Give me one more chance.

29:53.030 --> 29:53.730
Senior.

29:54.160 --> 29:56.090
♪Who can ever♪

29:56.090 --> 29:58.180
♪Predict the clock of time♪

29:58.440 --> 30:00.330
Who's the mentor here, you or me?

30:00.800 --> 30:02.840
♪The hearth smoke rises high♪

30:04.270 --> 30:05.050
Little rascal.

30:05.720 --> 30:07.420
I saw your every move coming.

30:07.420 --> 30:08.580
♪A varied life♪

30:08.680 --> 30:09.770
Thanks to your help,

30:09.880 --> 30:11.620
I can manage so well.

30:11.810 --> 30:14.020
♪I drink the breeze that comes my way♪

30:14.020 --> 30:15.870
♪The steadiest surge of all♪

30:16.220 --> 30:18.370
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

30:18.370 --> 30:20.260
♪Karma never falls empty♪

30:20.480 --> 30:22.510
♪Let the thoughts weigh♪

30:22.740 --> 30:24.670
♪Will fulfill our original vow♪

30:24.950 --> 30:26.030
♪Unruly♪

30:26.030 --> 30:28.940
♪A carefree smile♪

30:29.480 --> 30:30.420
I am here.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.700
Leave it all to me.

30:31.920 --> 30:32.620
Rest easy.

30:33.350 --> 30:34.730
So carefree and noble.

30:34.750 --> 30:36.460
Truly a lofty vision,

30:36.480 --> 30:37.570
a broad mind.

30:37.590 --> 30:38.530
Changgeng,

30:39.270 --> 30:40.220
you're human, right?

30:40.640 --> 30:42.940
Do not come at me!

30:46.950 --> 30:48.550
♪I scorn to ride the eastern wind♪

30:48.550 --> 30:50.500
♪Not hiding from fate's pursuit♪

30:50.780 --> 30:52.690
♪In this Primordial World♪

30:52.690 --> 30:55.000
♪Who's out there sword riding♪

30:55.160 --> 30:56.460
I am an Aureate Immortal.

30:56.480 --> 30:57.980
How could you rival me?

30:58.270 --> 31:00.090
Impossible.

31:00.480 --> 31:01.660
For loyalty.

31:01.680 --> 31:02.770
Charge!

31:03.810 --> 31:06.050
♪No one can predict the clock of time♪

31:06.050 --> 31:07.970
♪Then please, just relax♪

31:08.080 --> 31:10.800
♪How many night watches have passed by♪

31:11.750 --> 31:13.420
[The Sea Deity can grant great power!]
Do you want to join us?

31:14.900 --> 31:17.160
♪Let the answer be empty♪

31:17.590 --> 31:19.530
Blood for blood!

31:22.400 --> 31:23.180
Go ahead.

31:23.350 --> 31:24.220
Cut.

31:25.950 --> 31:28.250
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

31:29.460 --> 31:30.340
[Lost?]

31:30.380 --> 31:32.380
♪Let the thoughts weigh♪

31:32.540 --> 31:34.480
♪Will fulfill our original vow♪

31:34.890 --> 31:35.880
♪Unruly♪

31:35.880 --> 31:38.400
♪A carefree smile♪

31:38.400 --> 31:39.490
Come, come!

31:39.550 --> 31:42.980
Pull Strings!

31:45.100 --> 31:46.380
[South Heavenly Gate]

31:46.400 --> 31:48.460
Li Changshou of Ascendance Sect

31:49.030 --> 31:50.980
has served the Celestial Court
many times

31:51.440 --> 31:52.860
with sincere dedication

31:53.310 --> 31:54.620
and moved the heavens above.

31:55.960 --> 31:58.050
In the name of the Celestial Emperor,

31:58.590 --> 32:00.050
I hereby issue this imperial decree:

32:00.750 --> 32:05.180
Li Changshou is appointed Water Deity
of the Three Realms.

32:07.070 --> 32:08.050
Li Changshou,

32:08.880 --> 32:10.180
receive the decree.

32:19.880 --> 32:21.050
Li Changshou used to be

32:21.110 --> 32:22.860
so eager to come here before.

32:23.110 --> 32:24.530
Now that I'm bestowing a title on him,

32:24.550 --> 32:26.140
how dare he stand me up?

32:26.880 --> 32:28.140
What does "stand up" mean?

32:29.070 --> 32:29.860
Leave.

32:59.510 --> 33:01.180
I've been looking for you everywhere.

33:01.440 --> 33:02.660
Yi said you were here.

33:02.680 --> 33:03.460
I did not believe it.

33:03.480 --> 33:04.940
Yet here you are.

33:09.480 --> 33:11.090
In the past,

33:11.750 --> 33:14.290
we doubted and tested each other.

33:14.680 --> 33:16.250
We even fought without end.

33:16.440 --> 33:18.140
Who would have thought

33:18.240 --> 33:20.700
we would become such close friends?

33:22.200 --> 33:23.090
From now on,

33:23.510 --> 33:24.770
I shall call you little brother.

33:24.790 --> 33:25.770
What do you think?

33:26.640 --> 33:28.180
So, I have reached the point

33:28.270 --> 33:29.940
of being brothers with the Dragon King.

33:30.640 --> 33:31.380
Of course.

33:31.400 --> 33:33.700
Because you play it safe.

33:36.040 --> 33:36.690
Right.

33:37.480 --> 33:39.410
Why didn't you take office
at Celestial Court?

33:40.350 --> 33:41.860
The Great Tribulation is gone.

33:41.880 --> 33:43.290
Why rush to the Celestial Court?

33:44.960 --> 33:45.730
Then why

33:45.920 --> 33:47.490
don't you stay at Ascendance Sect?

33:49.160 --> 33:50.140
I just think

33:51.790 --> 33:53.570
it's nice to keep her company.

33:55.920 --> 33:57.860
As for that Great Tribulation,

33:58.070 --> 34:00.220
it was all my own pride.

34:00.790 --> 34:02.460
I'm truly grateful to you

34:02.480 --> 34:03.940
and Fairy Yunxiao.

34:04.440 --> 34:05.940
You showed me

34:06.640 --> 34:08.460
that I was terribly foolish.

34:09.590 --> 34:12.260
Thank you for guiding my son, Ao Yi.

34:12.760 --> 34:15.130
You brought the East Sea Dragon Clan
to the Celestial Court,

34:15.440 --> 34:16.780
so we no longer live

34:16.800 --> 34:18.610
in fear.

34:19.400 --> 34:20.980
You're now a hands-off ruler.

34:21.110 --> 34:21.900
How does that feel?

34:22.670 --> 34:23.460
It feels great.

34:23.480 --> 34:25.050
It's just wonderful.

34:25.110 --> 34:26.460
Had I known that,

34:26.550 --> 34:29.460
why fuss over petty schemes now?

34:41.230 --> 34:42.130
Little brother,

34:43.630 --> 34:44.860
I've noticed something.

34:45.190 --> 34:47.420
You're much like Fairy Yunxiao.

34:49.190 --> 34:49.980
In what way?

34:50.710 --> 34:52.650
You both love standing here,

34:52.670 --> 34:54.130
gazing at the Sea-Calming Pillar.

35:03.070 --> 35:04.210
What a coincidence.

35:04.710 --> 35:06.050
And stranger still,

35:06.670 --> 35:08.090
deep in your hearts,

35:08.110 --> 35:09.490
you both have other aims.

35:09.510 --> 35:11.460
Yet neither of you will say it.

35:13.920 --> 35:15.050
But rest easy.

35:15.150 --> 35:16.980
If you won't speak, I won't ask.

35:17.760 --> 35:20.340
I am but a muddled old dragon now.

35:20.360 --> 35:21.300
I'm of no use anymore.

35:25.280 --> 35:25.980
Oh, right.

35:26.190 --> 35:27.610
Yi said just now

35:27.880 --> 35:30.650
that more seek the Sea Deity Grandlord.

35:30.800 --> 35:32.530
He can't handle it alone.

35:32.670 --> 35:34.530
Do help him when you can.

35:34.840 --> 35:35.740
Go have a look.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.340
Very well, little brother.

35:38.710 --> 35:39.610
I'll take my leave.

35:48.760 --> 35:49.860
Though you do not remember,

35:50.320 --> 35:51.300
I once said

35:51.320 --> 35:52.340
that if we ever met again,

35:52.360 --> 35:53.860
I would kill you myself.

35:56.070 --> 35:58.010
Why is Yunxiao saving the world?

35:59.880 --> 36:01.050
Why not you?

36:08.670 --> 36:09.780
What are you laughing at?

36:12.400 --> 36:13.460
I was wrong.

36:14.800 --> 36:16.460
We were all wrong.

36:18.030 --> 36:18.860
Wrong about what?

36:19.710 --> 36:20.490
So,

36:22.800 --> 36:24.490
there are two Chosen Ones,

36:25.800 --> 36:28.130
and there are two Great Tribulations.

36:32.280 --> 36:33.900
The heroine of this tribulation

36:34.190 --> 36:35.690
is Yunxiao.

36:35.710 --> 36:36.610
And you

36:38.070 --> 36:39.740
are the hero of the next tribulation.

36:40.760 --> 36:41.740
Li Changshou,

36:42.920 --> 36:44.260
in our next life,

36:45.880 --> 36:46.780
we shall meet again.

36:49.320 --> 36:50.090
Yunxiao.

36:52.230 --> 36:53.210
I will guard

36:55.230 --> 36:57.460
your wish to the end.

37:02.420 --> 37:07.220
[To be continued]

37:37.990 --> 37:43.770
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

37:44.440 --> 37:51.140
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

37:52.670 --> 37:58.720
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

37:59.350 --> 38:05.800
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

38:06.540 --> 38:13.660
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

38:14.040 --> 38:20.940
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

38:21.320 --> 38:28.670
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

38:28.670 --> 38:35.840
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

38:51.980 --> 38:57.150
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

38:58.240 --> 39:05.260
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

39:06.450 --> 39:12.390
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

39:13.090 --> 39:20.170
♪Alas, our story is short♪

39:20.510 --> 39:27.620
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

39:27.940 --> 39:34.420
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

39:35.200 --> 39:42.410
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

39:42.800 --> 39:50.620
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
